{
  "category": "Daunting Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Although it possesses a violent temperament, it won’t put up with bullying. It uses the leaf in its mouth to sense the movements of its enemies.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "It charges ahead and bashes its opponents like a berserker, uncaring about any hits it might take. Its arms are mighty enough to snap a telephone pole.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "Although it possesses a violent temperament, it won’t put up with bullying. It uses the leaf in its mouth to sense the movements of its enemies.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "It charges ahead and bashes its opponents like a berserker, uncaring about any hits it might take. Its arms are mighty enough to snap a telephone pole.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It boasts superb physical strength. Those who wish to become Pangoro’s Trainer have no choice but to converse with their fists.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "From the slight twitches of its bamboo leaf, it deduces its opponent’s movements. It’s eager to tussle but kindhearted toward its companions.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "This rowdy Pokémon boasts great physical strength. Many Trainers are also smitten by its lively character.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pangoro is the type to talk with its fists. It doesn’t say much as it pummels opponents with enough force to send a dump truck flying.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "This Pokémon is quick to anger, and it has no problem using its prodigious strength to get its way. It lives for duels against Obstagoon.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using its leaf, Pangoro can predict the moves of its opponents. It strikes with punches that can turn a dump truck into scrap with just one hit.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
  ],
